Changes:
 ros-one-ur-description (1.5.0-2-g39ad110-2026.07.21.05.42) trixie; urgency=high
 .
   * Add support for UR15 (#702 <https://github.com/ros-industrial/universal_robot/issues/702>)
   * Fix materials for UR20 upper arm mesh (#699 <https://github.com/ros-industrial/universal_robot/issues/699>)
   * Update the inertia matrices for the UR5e and UR3e (#697 <https://github.com/ros-industrial/universal_robot/issues/697>)
     They have been updated from the CAD model and should be more accurate than
     the cylinder approximations
   * Add License files to packages (#695 <https://github.com/ros-industrial/universal_robot/issues/695>)
   * Contributors: Felix Exner
